              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haya yote ndiyo makabila kumi na mawili ya Israeli, na hivi ndivyo baba yao alivyowaambia alipowabariki, akimpa kila mmoja baraka inayomfaa.",
          "type": "text",
